.TH AUDIO_SET_MASTER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_set_master \- Set master gains 0..1 for effects and music separately (an options menu writes these; store the chosen values in GameState so a save remembers them)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "void audio_set_master(float sfx_gain, float music_gain);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set master gains 0..1 for effects and music separately (an options menu writes these; store the chosen values in GameState so a save remembers them). Music changes take effect at once; effects use the new gain from their next play.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audio_play (3),
.BR audio_music (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
